flowchart TD
    A[Main Agent] -->|branch_to_subtasks| B{BranchCoordinator}
    B --> C[Subagent 1: Hypothesis A]
    B --> D[Subagent 2: Hypothesis B]
    B --> E[Subagent 3: Hypothesis C]
    
    C --> F[Test & Explore]
    D --> G[Test & Explore]
    E --> H[Test & Explore]
    
    F -->|finish_subtask| I[Summary 1]
    G -->|finish_subtask| J[Summary 2]
    H -->|finish_subtask| K[Summary 3]
    
    I --> L[merge_results]
    J --> L
    K --> L
    
    L --> M[Main Agent resumes<br/>with merged summaries]
    
    style B fill:#f9f,stroke:#333
    style L fill:#9f9,stroke:#333